// Current KIELER (and the lab server) expects `const` after `input` / `output`: `output const int M = 4`.
// Official KIELER 0.3.0 (the KIELER VS Code extension) expects it first: `const output int M = 4` (basics.md 10.1).
scchart ConstAfterOutput {
  output const int M = 4
  const int N = 3
  output int o
  initial state A
  do o = M + N go to A
}
